OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers' concern at unauthorised
OL,4,Atravellers site
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers have called for urgent action
OL,7,Fto be taken against an unauthorised
OL,8,Ftravellers site of up to 50 caravans.
OL,10,FPeople living in Hillam near Sherburn
OL,11,Fin Elmet said the caravans had arrived
OL,12,Fon land off Betteras Hill Road a week
OL,13,Fago, and hardcore, fences and septic
OL,14,Ftanks had been installed.
OL,16,FNorth Yorkshire Council said it had
OL,17,Fserved a temporary stop notice on any
OL,18,Fwork on the site and was investigating
OL,19,F"further enforcement options".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
